    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII exclusive ownership of one <ref refid="classStmSpiBus" kindref="compound">StmSpiBus</ref> (RTOS mutex). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Higher-level threads may block here with a timeout — that is intentional. Do not disable interrupts across SPI frames; serialize with this lock. Direct HAL probes / wire-proof paths must take the same lock. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
